        : root.name == "volume-2" ? "M3 9v6h4l5 5V4L7 9H3zm13.5 3A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 14 7.97v8.05A4.47 4.47 0 0 0 16.5 12zM14 3.23v2.06a7 7 0 0 1 0 13.42v2.06A9 9 0 0 0 14 3.23z"
